  "request": "#931 w29 · the viewer shows the source ticket (P3).\nProblem: The record already has a place for the PR end of a spec (prUrl, prNumber) but none for the ticket end, and the overview dossier shows intent, approach and non-goals with no row for where the work came from. Even once w11 records a source, the viewer won't show, link or search it.\nProposed: Show `source` as a link in apps/vscode/webview/src/spec-viewer/components/OverviewDossier.tsx, make the specs filter (apps/vscode/src/features/specs/specExplorerProvider.ts, fuzzyMatch.ts) match the ticket id, and show `extends` or `supersedes` lineage in the dossier. Repository text reaches the panel as text, with links through safeUrl.\nAcceptance: A spec with source: TODO-42 shows a Source row in the dossier. A URL source opens through safeUrl; a plain id stays text. Filtering specs by TODO-42 finds the spec. The dossier shows the folder a spec extends.\nOwner: \"lets do them and reword\".",
